tionTemplate":"When you take them out, put aside and sprinkle with powdered sugar on top. This makes about 3 batches of 20 cookies each. Total count about 60 cookies.","durationMin":18,"timerSeconds":1080,"activeMeasureSummary":"Flour, Jam","criticalTip":"Let set for 5–10 minutes before slicing or plating so the textures hold crisp and photogenic!","creatorSecret":"Let the tray rest 5 minutes on the counter after baking so edges crisp while centers stay bakery-soft."}],"ugcQuotes":[{"id":"muq-53024","handle":"@baker_rogaliki","image":"./ai-images/rogaliki-polish-croissant-cookies.jpg","quote":"Followed the scaled metric steps—came out flawless in 33 mins!","rating":5}]}}]
